  "id": "locomotion",
  "term": "locomotion",
  "definition": "Locomotion is the act of moving from place to place, such as human walking. In this context, it refers especially to bipedal walking as a behavior that can be shaped by body control and sensory input, including touch-based interactions involving the arms and hands.",
